Believe it or not, many shields made throughout real human history
were made out of wood.  The reason - they're much lighter.  Also, they
helped to soften the impact of a blow, rather than take the full,
jarring blunt of it.  Of course, they didn't last as long :-D  Elves,
which one thinks of as more fragile than a human, would certainly
prefer a wooden shield over a metal one.

